# Origin of the gateway service (services/gateway, port 8080).
#
# Leave this BLANK (or omit the file entirely) to use the Vite dev proxy in
# vite.config.ts, which forwards /api to the gateway on the same origin — that
# is the simplest setup and sidesteps CORS completely.
#
# Set it explicitly when the gateway runs somewhere else, e.g. on another
# machine for a demo, or when serving a production build without a proxy.
VITE_GATEWAY_URL=
